WEBVTT

00:06:56.284 --> 00:07:00.286
someone who has always been
an apology, a secret, an imposition.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.363
And it was incredibly freeing

00:07:02.387 --> 00:07:05.176
to choose the name of a man
who chose me first.

00:07:05.963 --> 00:07:08.149
(Applause)

00:07:12.931 --> 00:07:15.975
TM: So we told some family
and some close friends,

00:07:15.999 --> 00:07:19.197
many of whom were still in disbelief
as we took our vows.

00:07:20.026 --> 00:07:23.115
Fittingly, we posted all of our wedding
photos on Facebook,

00:07:23.139 --> 00:07:24.340
where we met --

00:07:24.364 --> 00:07:26.089
and Instagram, of course.

00:07:26.642 --> 00:07:28.174
And we quickly realized

00:07:28.198 --> 00:07:31.396
that our coming together was more
than just a union of two people,